,{"_67":68,"_71":142,"_73":487,"_69":141,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":139,"_80":403,"_69":141,"_106":-7,"_82":43},{"_67":77,"_71":137,"_80":486,"_69":130,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":131,"_73":482,"_69":130,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":128,"_80":320,"_69":130,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":122,"_73":478,"_69":40,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":120,"_80":121,"_69":40,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":112,"_73":474,"_69":114,"_106":-7},{"_67":68,"_71":103,"_73":472,"_69":105,"_106":-7},{"_67":98,"_69":99,"_71":100,"_73":471,"_82":83},{"_67":84,"_69":85,"_71":467,"_87":468,"_89":469,"_40":470,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97},{"_67":77,"_69":78,"_71":79,"_80":466,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_69":70,"_71":72,"_73":463},[464],{"_71":72,"_33":465},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTExNzQwMi8zMDYzNzA4OS5qcGc=/original/qSShCX.jpg","2026-10-20","Creator-published gameplay screenshot from the itch.io page. The film-derived robot design retains the project-only restrictions recorded in the creator’s NOTICE.md.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/claude-dreaming-godot.webp","Claude Dreaming gameplay showing a robot floating near a small planet in purple space.","https://rusty-production.itch.io/claude-dreaming",[298],[473],{"_71":109,"_33":110},[475],{"_71":476,"_33":470,"_118":477},"查看作者的 AI 开发分工说明","The creator explicitly credits Claude and discloses assisted code, graphics, sounds, and text. This is an author disclosure and contribution workflow, not a complete development transcript.",[479],{"_71":310,"_33":480,"_118":481},"https://github.com/moritzfh/claude-dreaming","Full scenes, GDScript, levels, rooms, assets, film intro, and export presets. Run with Godot 4.7.2 standard: import project.godot and press F5. Code is MIT; original assets are CC BY 4.0, while film material and film-derived art have project-only restrictions in NOTICE.md.",[483],{"_71":484,"_33":470,"_118":485},"Play Claude Dreaming","In-development HTML5 game. WASD moves; mouse looks, Space jumps/glides, E enters paintings, R respawns, and Esc pauses. Menus are German; Claude speaks English. The film intro can be skipped.","itch.io",[488],{"_71":489,"_33":490,"_118":-7},"阅读用 Claude 添加梦境的指南","https://github.com/moritzfh/claude-dreaming/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md",[492,493,494,495],"Start the browser build; hold Enter to skip the film if desired.","Enter a painting and compare its movement with the attic and community rooms.","Import the full project in Godot 4.7.2 standard, then read the level template and contribution guide.","Create one small level through the published API and test entry, movement, respawn, and returning to the attic.","Rusty 将作品署名为 Rusty 与 Claude，并披露代码、图像、声音和文字均有 AI 辅助。仓库提供贡献说明与关卡接口，方便继续与 Claude 一起制作新梦境。",[492,493,494,495],{"_71":504,"_33":490,"_25":141},{"_71":484,"_33":470,"_25":320,"_118":485},{"_71":347,"_33":480,"_181":182,"_118":481},{"_71":503,"_33":470,"_118":477},[179],"Read the creator’s AI contribution disclosure","Read how to add a dream with Claude","example:deep-yellow-claude","deep-yellow-claude","DEEP YELLOW","在程序生成的后室中探索。这是一款第一人称回合制 Roguelike：移动或等待会触发战斗，装备组合与理智值共同影响每次冒险。","/zh/examples/deep-yellow-claude/",{"_27":506,"_29":507,"_31":508,"_168":336,"_164":427,"_160":171,"_156":569,"_9":570,"_141":571,"_130":572,"_40":573,"_114":574,"_105":575,"_315":576},[512,513,514,515,516,517,518,519,520,521,522,523,524,525,526,527,528,529,530,531,532],{"_67":29,"_80":507,"_69":29,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":169,"_80":508,"_69":31,"_106":-7,"_82":43},{"_67":77,"_71":166,"_80":336,"_69":168,"_106":157,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":162,"_80":414,"_69":164,"_106":165,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":158,"_80":159,"_69":160,"_106":161,"_82":43},{"_67":77,"_71":154,"_80":569,"_69":156,"_106":157,"_82":43},{"_67":98,"_71":147,"_148":149,"_73":564,"_69":9,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":142,"_73":561,"_69":141,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":139,"_80":140,"_69":141,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":137,"_80":486,"_69":130,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":131,"_73":557,"_69":130,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":128,"_80":320,"_69":130,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":313,"_73":553,"_69":315,"_106":-7},{"_67":68,"_71":122,"_73":549,"_69":40,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":120,"_80":121,"_69":40,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":112,"_73":544,"_69":114,"_106":-7},{"_67":68,"_71":103,"_73":541,"_69":105,"_106":-7},{"_67":98,"_69":99,"_71":100,"_73":540,"_82":83},{"_67":84,"_69":85,"_71":536,"_87":537,"_89":538,"_40":539,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97},{"_67":77,"_69":78,"_71":79,"_80":466,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_69":70,"_71":72,"_73":533},[534],{"_71":72,"_33":535},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDA2ODk3Ni8yNTU4NTg5NS5wbmc=/original/HZA7lO.png","The author’s Godot play-mode screenshot, retaining the original editor and debug panels.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/deep-yellow-claude.webp","A first-person yellow-corridor encounter with a held bat, inventory and minimap, inside the creator’s captured Godot editor.","https://aebrer.itch.io/deep-yellow",[102],[542,543],{"_71":109,"_33":110},{"_71":102,"_33":111},[545],{"_71":546,"_33":547,"_118":548},"查看 Claude Code 开发署名","https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow/blob/master/CREDITS.md#code-and-design","Creator attribution specifically names Claude via Claude Code. The itch page separately discloses AI assistance for code; no complete session transcript is supplied.",[550],{"_71":234,"_33":551,"_118":552},"https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow","Full Godot 4.6 project, scenes, scripts, assets, shaders, and export presets. The itch page lists code MIT and assets CC0, while CREDITS.md still leaves the original-code license undecided and some third-party licenses unspecified; inspect both before reuse.",[554],{"_71":138,"_33":555,"_118":556},"https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow/releases/tag/v0.13.0","Download — Prepared Windows and Linux builds, plus a self-hostable Web export. These are uploaded game builds, separate from automatic source archives. Release files were verified; native builds were not executed.",[558],{"_71":559,"_33":539,"_118":560},"Play DEEP YELLOW","In-development browser build plus Windows/Linux downloads. The creator recommends Chrome or a controller; Firefox mouse input has known problems. Includes horror themes and an interactive tutorial.",[562],{"_71":563,"_33":539,"_118":-7},"阅读作者的游戏与开发笔记",[565,566,567,568],"Play the interactive tutorial and compare moving, waiting, equipment, and sanity.","Read the creator’s AI disclosure and the project’s separate attribution file.","Import project.godot in Godot 4.6 and inspect the start menu, procedural levels, and turn systems.","Change one equipment or turn rule, then test a complete run and restart.","Drew Brereton 明确说明游戏代码由 Claude 辅助开发。项目署名进一步指出使用了 Claude Code，并将原创内容与外部着色器、纹理和字体分开列出。",[565,566,567,568],{"_71":580,"_33":539,"_25":184},{"_71":559,"_33":539,"_25":320,"_118":560},{"_71":260,"_33":551,"_181":182,"_118":552},{"_71":579,"_33":547,"_118":548},[179,178],[577],{"_345":138,"_33":555,"_25":129,"_118":578},"Prepared Windows and Linux builds, plus a self-hostable Web export. These are uploaded game builds, separate from automatic source archives. Release files were verified; native builds were not executed.","Read the explicit Claude Code credit","Read the creator’s game and development notes","example:polar-icecapade-claude","polar-icecapade-claude","Polar Icecapade","在冰面 3D 场景中滑行，用三段近战连击向前推进，射击时利用后坐力向后移动。穿过闸门、收集金币，在短篇 Game Jam 冒险中对抗老鼠政权。","/zh/examples/polar-icecapade-claude/",{"_27":582,"_29":583,"_31":584,"_168":642,"_164":427,"_160":171,"_156":638,"_418":643,"_9":633,"_141":644,"_130":645,"_40":646,"_114":647,"_105":648},[588,589,590,591,592,593,594,595,596,597,598,599,600,601,602,603,604,605,606,607],{"_67":29,"_80":583,"_69":29,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":169,"_80":584,"_69":31,"_106":-7,"_82":43},{"_67":77,"_71":166,"_80":642,"_69":168,"_106":157,"_82":83},{"_67":98,"_71":415,"_148":416,"_73":639,"_69":418,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":162,"_80":414,"_69":164,"_106":165,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":158,"_80":159,"_69":160,"_106":161,"_82":43},{"_67":77,"_71":154,"_80":638,"_69":156,"_106":157,"_82":43},{"_67":98,"_71":147,"_148":149,"_73":633,"_69":9,"_106":-7,"_82":43},{"_67":68,"_71":142,"_73":630,"_69":141,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":139,"_80":140,"_69":141,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":137,"_80":486,"_69":130,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":131,"_73":626,"_69":130,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":128,"_80":320,"_69":130,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":122,"_73":622,"_69":40,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":120,"_80":121,"_69":40,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":112,"_73":618,"_69":114,"_106":-7},{"_67":68,"_71":103,"_73":613,"_69":105,"_106":-7},{"_67":98,"_69":99,"_71":100,"_73":612,"_82":83},{"_67":84,"_69":85,"_71":608,"_87":609,"_89":610,"_40":611,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":295},{"_67":77,"_69":289,"_71":290,"_80":466,"_82":83},"The live first level after melee movement and a shot; ammo has fallen to 11/12.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/polar-icecapade-claude.webp","Polar Icecapade’s first icy 3D arena after melee propulsion and a shot, showing the moving character, gates, coins, timer and 11 of 12 ammunition.","https://evankurtzart.itch.io/polar-icecapade",[102],[614,615,616],{"_71":102,"_33":111},{"_71":109,"_33":110},{"_71":419,"_33":617},"/zh/resources/blender/",[619],{"_71":620,"_33":611,"_118":621},"Read the team’s explicit Claude Code assistance statement","The creators distinguish AI help with diagnosing and implementing core code from their own code review, modeling, animation and art. The page links the full game source and identifies Godot 4.6 and GDScript; its “No generative AI” content badge does not erase the separate coding-assistance disclosure.",[623],{"_71":396,"_33":624,"_118":625},"https://github.com/afenkurtz/Big-Mode-Game-Jam-2026/tree/main/slick","Complete Godot 4.6 project with levels, GDScript, GLB/FBX models, Blender authoring files, textures, UI and audio. The inspected tree has 292 files, about 239 MB. Open the slick folder; importing Blender authoring files may require a compatible Blender installation. No top-level game license was found; external sounds, music and fonts retain their separately credited terms.",[627],{"_71":628,"_33":611,"_118":629},"Play or download Polar Icecapade on itch.io","Mouse recommended: left-click performs melee propulsion, right-click shoots with recoil, and Escape pauses. Browser review reached the first level, moved, fired a projectile with ammo changing from 12 to 11, and opened pause. The roughly 170 MB web build has author-documented performance limits; Windows/Linux downloads are provided and mobile is not recommended. Later levels and a complete run were not tested.",[631],{"_71":632,"_33":611,"_118":-7},"Read the team’s development and asset breakdown",[634,635,636,637],"使用鼠标开始网页首关，测试冰面滑行和近战连击推进。","右键射击，对比向后的后坐力与近战向前推进。","阅读团队对 Claude Code 的说明，以及人工美术、动画和音频署名。","在 Godot 4.6 中打开 slick 工程，修改一项移动或闸门规则，检查首个房间、弹药、暂停与重开。","Aidan “Botodo” Connolly 和 Evan Kurtz 说明 Claude Code 帮助诊断问题、实现困难的核心逻辑，之后他们检查并调整了全部代码。建模、绑定、动画和设计由团队完成，音频另有署名；作者明确说明没有用生成式 AI 制作资产，也未给出编程模型版本。",[419,640,641],"Procreate","Affinity","Godot 4.6 · GDScript · 3D",[419,640,641],{"_71":632,"_33":611,"_25":184},{"_71":628,"_33":611,"_25":320,"_118":629},{"_71":396,"_33":624,"_181":182,"_118":625},{"_71":620,"_33":611,"_118":621},[178,179,649],"blender","example:katana-kitsune-godot","katana-kitsune-godot","Katana Kitsune: Prototype","选择狐妖剑士，在等距视角的动作肉鸽中迎战妖怪、管理体力、拾取道具并深入地牢。这个无声原型支持本地多人，当前源码还记录了后续队伍系统。","/zh/examples/katana-kitsune-godot/",{"_27":651,"_29":652,"_31":653,"_168":725,"_164":170,"_160":171,"_156":719,"_418":726,"_9":714,"_141":727,"_130":728,"_40":729,"_114":730,"_105":731},[657,658,659,660,661,662,663,664,665,666,667,668,669,670,671,672,673,674,675,676,677],{"_67":29,"_80":652,"_69":29,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":169,"_80":653,"_69":31,"_106":-7,"_82":43},{"_67":77,"_71":166,"_80":725,"_69":168,"_106":157,"_82":83},{"_67":98,"_71":415,"_148":416,"_73":720,"_69":418,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":162,"_80":163,"_69":164,"_106":165,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":158,"_80":159,"_69":160,"_106":161,"_82":43},{"_67":77,"_71":154,"_80":719,"_69":156,"_106":157,"_82":43},{"_67":98,"_71":147,"_148":149,"_73":714,"_69":9,"_106":-7,"_82":43},{"_67":68,"_71":142,"_73":710,"_69":141,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":139,"_80":140,"_69":141,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":77,"_71":137,"_80":486,"_69":130,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":131,"_73":706,"_69":130,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":128,"_80":320,"_69":130,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":122,"_73":702,"_69":40,"_106":-7},{"_67":77,"_71":120,"_80":121,"_69":40,"_106":-7,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_71":112,"_73":697,"_69":114,"_106":-7},{"_67":68,"_71":103,"_73":687,"_69":105,"_106":-7},{"_67":98,"_69":99,"_71":100,"_73":685,"_82":83},{"_67":84,"_69":85,"_71":681,"_87":682,"_89":683,"_40":684,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_96":97},{"_67":77,"_69":78,"_71":79,"_80":466,"_82":83},{"_67":68,"_69":70,"_71":72,"_73":678},[679],{"_71":72,"_33":680},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png","Creator-published combat screenshot from the silent Godot prototype.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/katana-kitsune-godot.webp","The creator’s Katana Kitsune combat screenshot with an isometric courtyard, the party, enemies, health bars and minimap.","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/blob/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png",[102,686],"GitHub Copilot",[688,689,690,691,692],{"_71":102,"_33":111},{"_71":109,"_33":110},{"_71":695,"_33":696},{"_71":693,"_33":694},{"_71":419,"_33":617},"Meshy API","/zh/resources/meshy/","PixelLab AI Agent Toolkit","/zh/resources/pixellab/",[698],{"_71":699,"_33":700,"_118":701},"Read the creator’s AI production disclosure","https://9-k9.itch.io/katanakitsune","The author explicitly names Claude Code and GitHub Copilot alongside image, sprite and 3D asset tools, and links the primary complete source repository. The README verifies the Godot version and explains which finished assets are included.",[703],{"_71":396,"_33":704,"_118":705},"https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune","Godot 4.7 project with scenes, GDScript, Dialogic addon and finished sprite assets. The inspected tree contains about 383 MB of files; no top-level game license was found. The upstream Meshy/Blender/PixelOver authoring pipeline is separate, while its finished runtime sprites are committed. The current source contains newer party/asset changes than the reviewed hosted prototype.",[707],{"_71":708,"_33":700,"_118":709},"Play Katana Kitsune on itch.io","Silent HTML5 prototype with keyboard and gamepad support. Space confirms player/device choices; allow a clear press and release between setup steps. The browser build loaded and reached player/device selection in review; combat and a complete dungeon run were not exercised. The download is large: about 184 MB of game data plus 40 MB of WebAssembly.",[711],{"_71":712,"_33":713,"_118":-7},"Read the game and asset-pipeline documentation","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune#readme",[715,716,717,718],"打开 itch 原型，选择一名真人玩家，认领键盘并选择服装。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，以及角色、战斗和精灵制作流程说明。","在 Godot 4.7 中通过 GL Compatibility 打开 project.godot；工程已包含可运行精灵和游戏场景。","调整一项战斗或生成参数，检查标题、选角、地牢、受伤和重开的完整衔接。","作者明确列出 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、GPT Image 2、PixelLab 和 Meshy 等制作工具。仓库记录了 Meshy 绑定动画、Blender 重定向和 PixelOver 精灵导出流程；没有说明确切编程模型或各助手的代码分工。游戏里的 NPC 队友并不是 AI 辅助开发的证据。",[721,722,723,419,724],"GPT Image 2","PixelLab","Meshy","PixelOver","Godot 4.7 · GDScript · 2D / GL Compatibility",[721,722,723,419,724],{"_71":712,"_33":713,"_25":184},{"_71":708,"_33":700,"_25":320,"_118":709},{"_71":396,"_33":704,"_181":182,"_118":705},{"_71":699,"_33":700,"_118":701},[178,179,732,733,649],"pixellab","meshy","resource:godot-engine","resource","通过场景、节点、资源和脚本组织项目的开源 2D / 3D 游戏引擎。","/zh/resources/",{"_27":179,"_803":109,"_160":804,"_67":805,"_802":736,"_797":796,"_33":794,"_68":806,"_779"